<section class="cs-shell cs-setup">
  <header class="cs-hero">
    <img class="cs-mark" src="modules/cold-storage/assets/branding/project-palimpsest.png" alt="Project Palimpsest">
    <div>
      <p class="cs-kicker">PALIMPSEST RECOVERY NODE // BAY CITY 2384 // ALTERED CARBON RPG {{systemVersion}}</p>
      <h2>Cold Storage: The Faces We Left Behind</h2>
      <p>Fresh world: Full Import. Existing world: Book Only preserves played actors; review the separate Continuity migration before any Actor edits.</p>
    </div>
  </header>
  {{#unless systemReady}}<p class="cs-continuity-danger" role="alert">This module needs Altered Carbon RPG {{requiredSystem}} or newer. Installed: {{systemVersion}}. Update the system before importing.</p>{{/unless}}
  <div class="cs-command-row">
    <button class="cs-primary" type="button" data-action="import" {{#unless systemReady}}disabled{{/unless}}><i class="fa-solid fa-database" aria-hidden="true"></i> Full Import — Fresh World</button>
    <button type="button" data-action="bookOnly"><i class="fa-solid fa-book" aria-hidden="true"></i> Import / Update Book Only</button>
    <button type="button" data-action="openBook"><i class="fa-solid fa-book-open" aria-hidden="true"></i> Open GM Book</button>
    <button type="button" data-action="openContinuity"><i class="fa-solid fa-brain" aria-hidden="true"></i> Continuity &amp; Psychosurgery</button>
    <button type="button" data-action="installMaps"><i class="fa-solid fa-map" aria-hidden="true"></i> Install / Update Zoned Maps</button>
    <button type="button" data-action="applyEmblems"><i class="fa-solid fa-id-badge" aria-hidden="true"></i> Apply Noir Emblems</button>
  </div>
  <section class="cs-panel">
    <div class="cs-panel-head"><h3>Six-of-eight selection</h3><span>ACTIVE DHF LOADOUT</span></div>
    <p>Select exactly six pregens. The remaining two are flagged as protected reserve stacks.</p>
    <div class="cs-pregen-grid">{{#each pregens}}<div class="cs-pregen"><label><input type="checkbox" name="activePregen" value="{{id}}" {{#if checked}}checked{{/if}}> <strong>{{name}}</strong></label><div class="cs-assign"><select data-user-for="{{id}}" aria-label="Player for {{name}}"><option value="">Unassigned</option>{{#each ../users}}<option value="{{id}}" {{#if (eq id ../userId)}}selected{{/if}}>{{name}}</option>{{/each}}</select><button type="button" data-action="assign" data-pc-id="{{id}}">Assign</button></div></div>{{else}}<p>No pregens yet. Run Full Import in a fresh world.</p>{{/each}}</div>
    <button class="cs-primary" type="button" data-action="applySelection">Apply six-pregen selection</button>
  </section>
  <p class="cs-hint"><i class="fa-solid fa-lock" aria-hidden="true"></i> Ownership is intentionally explicit. Contacts and GM identity data remain GM-only as Foundry Documents. Pregens are built with the system's own Character Creator rules: open them with the standard Altered Carbon sheet, Level Up and Clinical Console.</p>
</section>
